  "label": "Misogynous Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that women, particularly those in sex work, are inherently objectified, disposable, and deserving of violence. This stereotype reduces women to their bodies and commodifies their labor, framing them as 'hookers' who can be haggled over and ultimately killed without consequence. This is a core element of misogynistic hate and objectification.",
